<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">būprestis</span></b> , is,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούπρηστις ʽπρήθω</span>, to
		swell up). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A venomous beetle</i>, <i>whose sting
				caused a swelling in cattle</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 30, 4,
				10, § 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">31, 10, 46, §
			119</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Veg. 5, 14, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5,
				77, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 12, 8,
			5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Dig. 48, 8, 3, §
			3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A kind of vegetable</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 22,
				22, 36, § 78</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
